    End If
End Function

' Purpose: Resolves navigation pane group ribbon tab label from the supplied/current ADC state, using `End` where required by the lookup path.
' Public role: Inter-module public API. Other ADC modules call this routine directly; its Public visibility is part of the module-to-module contract.
' Parameters:
