'   groupDefinitionIndex (Input Optional; Variant): Caller-supplied group definition index data used as the authoritative definition input for this call, avoiding an unnecessary reload when already available.
'   suppliedSystemMacroDefinition (Input Optional; Variant): Caller-supplied supplied system macro definition data used as the authoritative definition input for this call, avoiding an unnecessary reload when
'   already available.
