' Purpose: Resolves and returns generated form lookup definition from the supplied inputs and the authoritative ADC definitions/state used by this module.
' Public role: Inter-module public API. Other ADC modules call this routine directly; its Public visibility is part of the module-to-module contract.
' Parameters:
